---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Tools">
  <section class="page-section wrap"><div class="eyebrow">02 / FOCUS</div><div class="page-heading"><h1>Less friction.<br /><span class="serif-word">More flow.</span></h1><p>A few small tools to clear your head.<br />No account. Just you and the task.</p></div>
    <div class="tool-shell"><div class="tool-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Tools"><button class="tab-button" role="tab" id="tab-timer" aria-controls="timer" aria-selected="true" data-tool="timer">◷ &nbsp; Focus timer</button><button class="tab-button" role="tab" id="tab-json" aria-controls="json" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tool="json">{ } &nbsp; JSON studio</button><button class="tab-button" role="tab" id="tab-text" aria-controls="text" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tool="text">Aa &nbsp; Word counter</button></div>
      <section class="tool-panel" id="timer" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-timer"><div class="tool-panel-heading"><div><h2>One thing at a time.</h2><p>A little structure for your next stretch of focus.</p></div><span class="privacy-label">SAVED ON THIS DEVICE</span></div>
        <div class="timer-layout"><div class="timer-display"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="140"/><circle class="timer-progress" cx="150" cy="150" r="140"/></svg><span class="timer-stage" id="timer-stage">FOCUS SESSION</span><div class="timer-digits" id="timer-digits" role="timer" aria-label="Remaining time">25:00</div><span class="timer-status" id="timer-status" role="status">Find your flow.</span></div>
        <div class="timer-options"><div class="segmented" aria-label="Timer mode"><button data-stage="focus" aria-pressed="true">Focus</button><button data-stage="break" aria-pressed="false">Short break</button></div><div class="field-grid"><label>Focus (minutes)<input id="focus-minutes" type="number" min="1" max="180" value="25" /></label><label>Break (minutes)<input id="break-minutes" type="number" min="1" max="60" value="5" /></label></div><div class="action-row"><button class="button primary" id="timer-start">Start session <span>→</span></button><button class="button" id="timer-reset">Reset</button></div><p class="help-text">Take a breath. Pick one thing. Begin.<br />Your timer keeps time even in another tab. Switch sessions when you're ready.</p></div></div>
      </section>
      <section class="tool-panel" id="json" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-json" hidden><div class="tool-panel-heading"><div><h2>A little order for your data.</h2><p>Format, compact, and copy JSON in a couple of clicks.</p></div><span class="privacy-label">PROCESSED ONLY IN YOUR BROWSER</span></div><div class="editor-grid"><div><label class="editor-label" for="json-input">Input <span>JSON</span></label><textarea id="json-input" spellcheck="false" placeholder={'{"hello":"world","focus":true}'}></textarea></div><div><label class="editor-label" for="json-output">Output <span>READ ONLY</span></label><textarea id="json-output" readonly spellcheck="false" placeholder="A little more readable, right here."></textarea></div></div><div class="action-row"><button class="button primary" id="json-format">Format JSON</button><button class="button" id="json-compact">Compact</button><button class="button" id="json-copy">Copy output</button><button class="button" id="json-clear">Clear</button></div><p class="inline-status" id="json-status" role="status"></p></section>
      <section class="tool-panel" id="text" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-text" hidden><div class="tool-panel-heading"><div><h2>Make every word count.</h2><p>A quick look at the shape of your writing.</p></div><span class="privacy-label">PROCESSED ONLY IN YOUR BROWSER</span></div><div class="stats-grid"><div class="stat-card"><strong id="stat-characters">0</strong><span>Characters</span></div><div class="stat-card"><strong id="stat-compact">0</strong><span>Without spaces</span></div><div class="stat-card"><strong id="stat-words">0</strong><span>English words</span></div><div class="stat-card"><strong id="stat-chinese">0</strong><span>Chinese characters</span></div><div class="stat-card"><strong id="stat-lines">0</strong><span>Lines</span></div></div><label class="editor-label" for="text-input">Your text</label><textarea id="text-input" placeholder="Start with a thought. Paste a paragraph. See where it takes you."></textarea><div class="action-row"><button class="button" id="text-copy">Copy text</button><button class="button" id="text-clear">Clear</button></div><p class="help-text">Characters include spaces and punctuation. English words use Latin letters; Chinese characters are counted individually.</p></section>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script>import '../scripts/tools';</script>
</Layout>
